{
  "_comment": "Frontier sources retrieved by `cli.py feeds` into the same store as X bookmarks. Kinds: rss (RSS/Atom URL), index (a page whose links under `prefix` are the items), page (one page whose text is stored again whenever it changes), arxiv (an arXiv API query), last30days (a topic run through the last30days engine). `tier` and `name` are labels for the consumer; retrieval does not rank. `defaults` apply to every source unless the source overrides them; items with no date (index pages) are always kept.",
